{
  "schema": "ld-s10y-image/figure-spec@2",
  "id": "fig-choice-n21-measured",
  "mode": "deterministic",
  "description": "Use the ten measured points V=0.5,1,1.5,2,2.5,3,3.5,4,4.5,5 paired with m=1.12,1.54,1.91,2.33,2.72,3.10,3.53,3.92,4.34,4.71. Plot the user-specified approximate fitted line m=0.8V+0.72, without claiming an exact fit or an exact original source model. The residuals measured-minus-model are0,0.02,-0.01,0.01,0,-0.02,0.01,0,0.02,-0.01. Convert the source table into a new measured scatter representation; add an approximate model line and units V(L),m(kg). Do not label the inferred0.72 intercept or0.8 slope as text, and do not move the actual observations onto the line.",
  "source": {
    "authoredBasis": "Use the ten measured points V=0.5,1,1.5,2,2.5,3,3.5,4,4.5,5 paired with m=1.12,1.54,1.91,2.33,2.72,3.10,3.53,3.92,4.34,4.71. Plot the user-specified approximate fitted line m=0.8V+0.72, without claiming an exact fit or an exact original source model. The residuals measured-minus-model are0,0.02,-0.01,0.01,0,-0.02,0.01,0,0.02,-0.01. Convert the source table into a new measured scatter representation; add an approximate model line and units V(L),m(kg). Do not label the inferred0.72 intercept or0.8 slope as text, and do not move the actual observations onto the line. This is newly authored mathematics, not a recovered original. Figure 77 was visually inspected only for general axes styling and is not provenance. Numeric scales, plotting windows and panel layout are deliberate authored additions. No formula is printed on the graph.",
    "authoritativeText": [
      {
        "lesson": "alg6-c2-s4-n21",
        "exercise": "325",
        "text": "经过称重以后，得到煤油罐连同煤油的质量 $m$（公斤）和煤油容积 $V$（升）之间的关系表：作出图象，说明 $m$ 对 $V$ 的依赖关系是线性函数。求空罐的质量。$1$ 升煤油的质量是多少公斤？"
      },
      {
        "lesson": "alg6-c2-s4-n21",
        "text": "式 $y=kx+l$ 给出的函数，它的图象的位置决定于 $k$ 和 $l$的值的大小。"
      },
      {
        "lesson": "alg6-c2-s4-n21",
        "text": "系数 $k$ 决定线性函数的图象对 $x$ 轴的倾斜角的大小。\n如果 $k$ 是正数，那么倾斜角是锐角（图 $79$a）；\n如果 $k$ 是负数，那么倾斜角是钝角（图 $79$b）。\n\n数 $k$ 叫做直线的斜率。"
      },
      {
        "lesson": "alg6-c2-s4-n21",
        "text": "如果 $x=0$，那么 $y=l$。\n就是说，线性函数的图象和 $y$ 轴的交点，纵坐标等于 $l$。"
      }
    ],
